ests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["agent-factory","cloudflare-pages","landing-page","open-source","static-site","website"],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":61,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/pulls/189","html_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite/pull/189","diff_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite/pull/189.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite/pull/189.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-24T12:32:28Z"},"body":"Small follow-up PR to #181 against `book` (openwizdev/OpenWiz#2967):\n\n## What changed\n\n1. **Calendar-date stepping across spring DST (`book/book.js`):** `buildDayList()` now resolves today’s local calendar date `(year, month, day)` in the visitor’s time zone and steps by Gregorian calendar date (`Date.UTC(year, month - 1, day + i, 12, 0, 0)`) instead of adding 24-hour milliseconds, so it never skips the day after a spring-forward DST transition. Added `runDstChecks()` in `scripts/book-check.mjs` testing the last hour before spring DST in both `America/New_York` and `Europe/London`.\n2. **Month-change label keeps the weekday (`book/book.js`, `book/book.css`):** At a month boundary, the day cell keeps its weekday (`TUE`) and renders the month (`DEC`) as a small extra label above it instead of replacing the weekday. Verified in `scripts/book-check.mjs`.\n3. **Closed state no longer repeats itself (`book/index.html`, `book/book.js`):** Keeps the heading `\"Booking is closed right now\"` and sets the body to `\"Check back soon, or see the team page for how the call works.\"` (no email address / no `mailto:`).\n4. **Confirmation copy when `email !== \"sent\"` (`book/book.js`):** Changed from `\"You’re booked. Save the time below.\"` to `\"No email is coming, so add it to your calendar now.\"` (keeps `\"A confirmation is on its way to <email>.\"` when `email === \"sent\"`).\n\n## Proof (`122f17d`)\n\n```text\n> npm run build\nStatic site: 114 public files in dist/ (..., book/book.5df1d377de.css, book/book.6adbc8a3f0.js, ...)\n\n> npm run check\nPASS: pinned WebP artwork and spec recording within budget; the launch video within its own budget\nPASS: exact export, local links/fragments, CSS resources, fonts/licences, copy and privacy\n\n> npm test\n.......................................................\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 55 tests in 265.801s\n\nOK\n\n> node scripts/book-check.mjs --shots /tmp/shots-followup\nPASS: book-check (390px, 1280px, keyboard, states, cancel, DST, installability, offline)\n\n> python3 -I tools/comment-check/check.py diff --base origin/book\ncomment-check: ok\n```\n\nBuilt with [Cloudroom](https://cloudroom.dev)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/issues/189/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/issues/189/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"jparker2006","id":85816763,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE2NzYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85816763?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jparker2006","html_url":"https://github.com/jparker2006","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jparker2006/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jparker2006/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jparker2006/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jparker2006/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jparker2006/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jparker2006/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jparker2006/repos","events_url":"https: